  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoerio tokaonchoka, tokageenda gochia ase erooro goetera ase enchera egochia ase omosomo bwa Akaba, buna Omonene konya anteebiire. Ase amatuko amaange, tokaba tokonakoong’anyaong’anya ase ense y’ebitunwa bia Edomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene agakwana nainche, aganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwabeire mokona koong’anya-ong’anya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ase ense eye y’ebitunwa ase engaki entambe eisaine; bono onchoka mogende gochia ensemo ya Sugusu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende aganteebia: Bachiike abanto, obateebie ng’a ’mbare ang’e goeta ase orogongo rw’ abanto bamwabo, abanto b’ororeeria rwa Esau, abwo bamenyete Edomu. Barabwo nigo barabairoke. Ase ayio mwerende mono,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "timobaisa korwana nabarabwo, ekiagera tinkobaa inwe ense yabo nonya n’enseemo enke eisaine egesanyi gi’okogoro, ekiagera naeire abanto b’ororeeria rw’Esau ense y’ebitunwa ya Edomu ebe eyaabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo moragore endagera n’amache korwa ase bare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyora buna Omonene Nyasae oino, abasesenirie ase emeremo yaino yonsi mwabeire mogokora. Nigo abeire obarendete ase orogeendo rwaino ase erooro eye enene ase emiaka eye emerongo ene. Omonene Nyasae oino, obeire amo nainwe, na inwe timwaremeretwe na gento kende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio tokaimoka, tokagenderera, togatiga enchera ekogenda ase emechie ya Elati, na Esioni‐Geberi gochia ase ekerubo Ekiomo, erio tokaonchoka, tokageenda gochia ase erooro ya Moabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene aganteebia: Timobaisa gochegia abanto ba Moabu abanto b’ororeeria rwa Loti, gose korwana na barabwo Nabaeire omochie o Ari tinkobaa inwe ensemo ende yonsi y’ense yabo ebe eyaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Amamonto are korokwa Abaemi nabwo bamenyete agwo Ari. Abanto abwo nigo barenge abanene, bareng’aine na Abanaki abwo nabarabwo barenge amamonto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na buna Abanaki abwo nigo barenge korokwa Abarefai, korende Abamoabu nigo barenge kobaroka Abaemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahori nigo bakamenyire Edomu, korende abanto b’ororeeria rw’Esau bakabaseeria na gosaria ense yabo, bakamenya ase ense eria ribagaa riabo. Bagakora buna Abaisraeli bakorete ase ense eri’Omonene abaete ebe eyaabo.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende Omonene agatoteebia: Bono imoka, mogende mwamboke gochia ng’umbu y’akarooche ga Seredi. Erio tokageenda, tokaamboka akarooche akwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa engaki twarwete Kadeshi‐Barinea goika ekero twambogete akarooche ga Seredi nigo yarenge emiaka emerongo etato, na etano na etato (38). Abanto bonsi b’ekegori keria, abamanyete korwana esegi, bagakwa bakaera, buna Omonene konya atianire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo agendererete koamererania nabarabwo, goika bonsi bagasira kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero abarwani bonsi b’esegi konya bakuure,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene aganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reero moetere orobebe rwa Moabu ase enchera ya Ari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero moraike ang’e n’ense y’Abaamoni, abanto b’ororeeria rwa Loti, timobaisa kobachegia gose kobarwania esegi, ekiagera tinkobaa inwe nonya n’enseemo eyemo y’orogongo orwo nabaeire barabwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Orogongo orwo nigo naende rwamanyekanete buna ense y’Abarefai. Erieta ri’abanto abwo bamenyeteo agwo kare, korende Abaamoni bakabaroka Abasamusumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto aba nigo barenge abanene naende abatambe buna Abanaki; boigo nigo barenge abange. Korende Omonene akabasiria, na Abaamoni bakaba bakomenya ase ense eria ribaga riabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo Omonene akorerete abanto b’ororeeria rw’Esau, baria bamenyete ase ense y’ebitunwa ya Edomu. Agaita Abahori, na Abaesau bakaba bakomenya ase ense eria ribaga riabo, nao bamenyete goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaavi nigo bamenyete agwo ase Emechie yarenge ensemo ase enyancha ya Mediterania goika Gaza. Abakafitori korwa ase egesinga gia Kaptori bagaita Abaavi bakaba bakomenya ase ense eria ribaga riabo.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende Omonene agateeba: Imoka, mochaake orogeendo rwaino, mwamboke orooche rw’Arinoni. Naama! Nabeekire ase amaboko aino Sihoni Omoamori, omorwoti o Hesiboni, amo n’ense yaye. Ase igo, mochaake komorwania esegi, moire ense yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reero ninchaake kogosa abanto bonsi bare inse y’erioba, erinde baabairoke na koboboa ekero bakoigwa chinkuma chiaino, nabatengechigwe n’omoondoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bakobua omorwoti Sihoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Omob 21:21-30)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erio ngatoma abanto korwa ase erooro ya Kedemoti, bakageenda ase Sihoni, omorwoti o Hesiboni, nkamotomera amang’ana y’omorembe, ngateeba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koranche onyanchere ng’etere ase ense yao. Nigo ndaete ase enchera enene yoka; tinkogobera aande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nong’oonerie endagera indie na amaache inywe, nainche ninkoe chitaabu. Aye ing’a ribaga ng’ete n’amagoro ase ense yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buna abanto b’ororeeria rw’Esau, abamenyete Edomu, na Abamoabu, abamenyete Ari, bankorerete, naye onkorere boigo, goika imbe nambokire orooche rwa Yorodani, na nasoire ase ense eri’Omonene Nyasae oito, agochia gotoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende Sihoni, omorwoti o Hesiboni, akaanga, tatoa ribaga toete ase ense yaye Omonene Nyasae oino. Nigo akong’etie enkoro yaye ekaba ey’ogotaigwera, akamobeka ase amaboko aino, na inwe mokamobua na mokaira ense yaye, eyio tobwate goika rero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene aganteebia: Rora, nachaakire kobeeka Sihoni amo n’ense yaye ase amaboko aino. Ase ayio, chaaka koira ense yaye ebe eyaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Sihoni amo n’abanto baye bonsi bagaacha gotorwania esegi, ekero twarenge ase omochie o Yahasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende Omonene Nyasae oito, akamobeka ase amaboko aito, ere amo n’abamura baye, na abanto baye bonsi, na intwe tokabaita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eria tokabwata emechie yaye yonsi, tokayesaria, togaita abasacha, n’abakuungu, na abana, titwatigaretie monto ore moyo, nonya n’oyomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Togoosa chitugo chiabo, na gosakora ebinto biarenge ase emechie eyio bikaba ebiaito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa Aroeri, omochie oria ore ase engegu y’orooche rw’Arinoni, goika Gileadi, amo n’omochie ore ase rikura, omochie onde torenge ne chindwaki chinkong’u totanyaarete gotagora. Omonene Nyasae oito, nigo abegete emechie yonsi ase amaboko aito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende titwaigete ang’e ase ense y’Abaamoni, gose ase chingegu chi’orooche rwa Yaboki, na emechie y’ense y’ebitunwa, na aande onsi ase Omonene Nyasae oito, atokanetie titogeendao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
